    "title": "Parade marshals from local businesses are chosen for La Crosse Oktoberfest this year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brad Williams ,\n1 days ago Two members of the La Crosse area business community will lead the Oktoberfest parades for 2026. Local realtor Douglas Billings and jewelry store owner Karla Doolittle were introduced Tuesday as the parade marshals for the fest which officially opens on September 24th. The north-side Torchlight Parade on that night will... Read full article\n1",
